4. In the web interface of github.com, within the deceptive_design_scrape repo go to Settings > Pages 
    leave 'Deploy from a branch' as the Source option
    set Branch option to 'master' branch 'docs' directory and click Save
and .... there's nothing there. 
   looks like it just took a little time. I returned to the https://github.com/MaxWhitney/deceptive_design_scrape/settings/pages page and it had a new message that 'Your site is live at https://maxwhitney.github.io/deceptive_design_scrape. Clicked on 'Visit site' and sure as that there was a cupper website viewable there. It is however the default version, because I have not yet pushed my local modifications to github.

Update github.io version:
1. In desktop github tool commit changes, and then push to master.
2. Wait 1 minutet
3. View https://maxwhitney.github.io/deceptive_design_scrape. If there is no change, refresh or force refresh.
Success!
